"That work has its own page: [Artivism](project.html#heroes). The series are [The Israeli Spring](series.html#israeli-spring), [Every Day Heroes](series.html#every-day-heroes), [Harun](series.html#harun), [Red Brigade](series.html#red-brigade) and [Red Sea](series.html#red-sea)."
