"A portrait for me is not about posing or perfection. At Midburn I made portraits of burners in the dust, at Kibbutz Ein Carmel of artists in their workshops, and with dancers and artists I made portraits we built together. [Scattered Portraits](series.html#portraits-scattered), [Burners](series.html#burners), [Ein Carmel Artists](series.html#ein-carmel)."
